### Send with Resend (Recommended) - Manual Rendering

Source: https://github.com/resend/react-email/blob/canary/skills/react-email/references/SENDING.md

Render a React Email component to HTML and plain text, then use the Resend MCP tool to send.

```typescript
import { render } from 'react-email';
import { WelcomeEmail } from './emails/welcome';

// Render to HTML
const html = await render(
  <WelcomeEmail name="John" verificationUrl="https://example.com/verify" />
);

// Create plain text version
const text = await render(<WelcomeEmail name="John" verificationUrl="https://example.com/verify" />, { plainText: true });

// Use Resend MCP send-email tool with:
// - to: recipient@example.com
// - subject: Welcome to Acme
// - html: html
// - text: text
```

