### Team Invitation Email Component

Source: https://github.com/resend/react-email/blob/canary/skills/react-email/references/PATTERNS.md

A React Email component for sending team invitation emails, showcasing Tailwind CSS utility classes, proper component usage with `pixelBasedPreset`, TypeScript typing, and preview props for testing.

